Admixture	CATEGORY:Spheres Magic Talent	TYPE:SpheresMagicTalent.Destruction	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Spheres Magic Talent,Destruction Sphere	DESC:Combine two blast types by adding one casting-time step or one spell point. Split damage equally between types and apply both riders. Mixed d8/d6 uses d8; d8/d4 uses d6; d6/d4 uses d4.
# Mechanical summaries only. Source URLs and edition boundaries: docs/spheres.md.
# Knowing a blast type does not permanently replace the base blast.
